WEBVTT

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:04.680
Writing a bid by yourself is a lot of work.

00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:10.450
Velstrian Bid helps a small team put a bid together, without needing a bid department.

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:15.260
A tender is a public or private buyer asking suppliers to bid for work.

00:00:15.710 --> 00:00:22.950
Start on the Opportunities screen: one search over Find a Tender, Contracts Finder and Public Contracts Scotland.

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:29.440
Each tender gets a relevance score based on your past bids, worked out the same way every time. No AI in the loop.

00:00:29.890 --> 00:00:36.930
Upload the tender pack and it is read for you, giving you a list of questions to check. Then give each question an owner.

00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:42.660
Draft from your own documents and past answers, and see which document each point came from.

00:00:43.110 --> 00:00:49.630
For public work, add your social value answer. Velstrian Bid is built around PPN zero two six.

00:00:50.080 --> 00:00:54.440
Review, then export your response as a Word or PDF pack.

00:00:54.890 --> 00:00:58.810
Velstrian Bid. Bid with confidence, with less of the grind.
